WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.738
Let’s walk through Deck.

00:00:01.738 --> 00:00:04.050
Use the deck to pace and structure the room while

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.250
keeping the active phase visible.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.725
It supports facilitation, but the team artifact remains the

00:00:09.725 --> 00:00:12.887
durable record and must be reviewed separately.

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:15.825
On this slide, move through the assigned support deck

00:00:15.825 --> 00:00:19.200
and keep the projected discussion aligned to the active exercise

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.238
phase.

00:00:20.238 --> 00:00:23.387
In practice, the deck structures facilitation;

00:00:23.387 --> 00:00:26.000
it is not the durable decision record and does not

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.462
submit an artifact.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.510
When you are ready, use Open Deck to move

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.985
to the live surface.

00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:34.660
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:34.810
.
